MSH ─ Message Header
 ├─ SFT (optional, repeating – software segment)
 ├─ UAC (optional – user authentication credentials, new in 2.5)
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – general message-level notes)
PID ─ Patient Identification
 ├─ PD1 (optional – additional patient demographics)
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – patient-level comments)
 ├─ NK1 (optional, repeating – next of kin / associated parties)
 ├─ PV1 (optional – patient visit)
 │   ├─ PV2 (optional – additional visit info)
 │   ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – visit-level comments)
 │   ├─ ROL (optional, repeating – roles such as attending, referring, consulting)
 │   ├─ DG1 (optional, repeating – diagnosis)
 │   ├─ DRG (optional, repeating – diagnosis-related groups)
 │   ├─ AL1 (optional, repeating – allergies)
 │   ├─ PR1 (optional, repeating – procedures)
 │   ├─ GT1 (optional, repeating – guarantor)
 │   ├─ IN1 (optional, repeating – insurance)
 │   │   ├─ IN2 (optional – additional insurance info)
 │   │   ├─ IN3 (optional, repeating – certification info)
 │   │   └─ ROL (optional, repeating – insurance roles)
 │   ├─ ACC (optional – accident info)
 │   ├─ UB1 (optional – universal billing 1)
 │   ├─ UB2 (optional – universal billing 2)
 │   └─ Zxx (optional – custom/local extensions)
 ├─ OBX (optional, repeating – observations)
 │   ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – observation notes)
 └─ Zxx (optional – custom extensions)
ORC ─ Common Order (optional, repeating)
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – order-level comments)
 ├─ ROL (optional, repeating – order roles)
 ├─ TQ1 (optional, repeating – timing quantity)
 ├─ TQ2 (optional, repeating – timing/quantity relationship)
 ├─ OBR (Observation Request – repeating group)
 │   ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – observation notes)
 │   ├─ ROL (optional, repeating – provider/role info)
 │   ├─ TQ1 (optional, repeating)
 │   ├─ TQ2 (optional, repeating)
 │   ├─ OBX (Observation Result – repeating)
 │   │   ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – result-level comments)
 │   │   ├─ ROL (optional, repeating)
 │   │   ├─ PRT (optional, repeating – participation info, new in 2.5.1)
 │   ├─ TCD (optional – test code details)
 │   ├─ SPM (optional, repeating – specimen)
 │   │   ├─ OBX (optional, repeating – specimen-level observations)
 │   │   │   ├─ NTE (optional, repeating)
 │   │   └─ SAC (optional, repeating – specimen containers)
 │   ├─ PRT (optional, repeating – participant info)
 │   ├─ FT1 (optional, repeating – financial transactions)
 │   └─ Zxx (optional – custom site-specific extensions)
 ├─ PRT (optional, repeating – participant information)
 ├─ FT1 (optional, repeating – financial transactions)
 └─ Zxx (optional, repeating)
DG1 ─ Diagnosis
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – diagnosis comments)
AL1 ─ Allergy Information
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating)
PR1 ─ Procedure
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – procedure-level notes)
GT1 ─ Guarantor
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – guarantor comments)
IN1 ─ Insurance
 ├─ IN2 (optional – additional insurance)
 ├─ IN3 (optional, repeating – certification)
 ├─ ROL (optional, repeating)
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – insurance notes)
ACC ─ Accident
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – accident notes)
UB1 ─ Universal Bill 1 (optional)
UB2 ─ Universal Bill 2 (optional)
Zxx ─ Custom/local extensions
